#: audio/mpeg
msgid "MPEG audio layer 3"
msgstr "MPEG audio layer 3 MP3 Audio"

# null
#: audio/mpeg@definition
msgid "MPEG-1 Audio layer-3 is an audio compression algorithm and file format defined in ISO 11172-3 and ISO 13818-3. MP3 has an adjustable sampling frequency for highly compressed telephone to CD quality audio."
msgstr ""

